{"reviewId": "426066534_88RBQlMcN", "review": {"abstract": "2004年美国步入长波衰退之后，至2007年世界经济的通胀问题已经越发明显", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "中国廉价出口品主要抑制的是发达国家的消费品通胀，但无法对冲2004-2007年由全球总需求过热、流动性过剩及大宗商品（尤其是能源和食品）价格暴涨引发的全局性通胀压力，入世后的中国既是“抑制通胀的力量”，也是巨大的“需求制造机”，其需求增长直接推高了大宗商品价格。\n总的来说，2004-2007年全球通胀升温，本质上是强劲经济扩张、空前流动性过剩及大宗商品超级周期等结构性动力，压过了中国入世带来的“一次性”供给侧通缩红利。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "3323-3360", "createTime": 1777938845, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "426066534_88RBQlMcN", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1778458635, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 59410043, "name": "彭颖睿", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/VXbpqqQMOrEtxmI7TibXr8BWzfttIUnoCEtL1xmhuq9O6d64RgMkS7fZA5qT5eSTXnmI0fChq4YuscBSPADQdQ4lPUKpap672xLstmT4sHE0/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc":